ress":"浙江","ucode":"A92D3BA6CA546E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/8a/50/1ac12c3c.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1772342592,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":150617,"content":"现在业界越来越偏向原生调用，主要也是模型越来越强吧。我个人觉得，如果用好的模型，使用原生的，如果是能力不那么好的，用prompt更稳定，因为function call需要模型一上来就知道要调用工具，而prompt的方式，在输出thouht的过程，模型可能才会意识到要调用工具，从而输出，这样工程可以做个容错，但是代价是额外的成本。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1521002,"ctime":1772415941,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":405599,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101114301,"comment_content":"老师，CrewAI 是通过提示词的方式来进行工具选择的，但现在主流大模型的 API 都支持原生的 tools 参数（即 Function Calling）。我想请教一下，在工具选择这件事上，用提示词注入的方式和用 OpenAI 兼容 API 的 tools 参数这两种方案，哪种更好？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1521002,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/35/6a/7997de5a.jpg","nickname":"晓寒","note":"","ucode":"8BB0F59591B8CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":681719,"discussion_content":"现在业界越来越偏向原生调用，主要也是模型越来越强吧。我个人觉得，如果用好的模型，使用原生的，如果是能力不那么好的，用prompt更稳定，因为function call需要模型一上来就知道要调用工具，而prompt的方式，在输出thouht的过程，模型可能才会意识到要调用工具，从而输出，这样工程可以做个容错，但是代价是额外的成本。","content_length":433,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1772415941,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":405572,"user_name":"Geek_369c27","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1907910,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"4F0AC91FAF9DF9","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKgLndj7pLSdRGhcN7t7GjD0iconE5ggvzPOdX4U0FbJlXypR4bDt7VmW4alic7ftiau5pQZ8Rb1p93w/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":177